Oddjob's Bowler, besides being a natty chapeau, also
acted as a thrown weapon with a beheading attack.

Gloves of incubus alluring would help take care of
that persistent headache problem. [Did you know that
if you keep chatting up a foocubus who seems to have
a headache, you'll often get some action of the
non-melee sort? Sure surprised me!]

I don't suppose Inspector Gadget's Swiss Army Knife
